{"version":1,"key":"card:478","content":{"id":478,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5932e8b9-7ed4-4f6f-828b-882846f9e1e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模块 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"os"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 让你能够访问多个操作系统服务。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"os"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 及其子模块 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"os.path"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还包含多个查看、创建和删除目录及文件的函数，以及一些操作路径的函数（例如，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"os.path.split"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"os.path.join"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 让你在大多数情况下都可忽略 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"os.pathsep"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2e25533e-6782-401e-8ac7-441ef984322a.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"0736e0cb-3b9c-432c-a5a0-599fc2449af7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"bba8225a-2b78-47de-9cd5-97c76bfdb693","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"dc9f5242-1246-446b-b2b8-45521d10ca74","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"38d0f1e3-593c-42da-9596-356710b61e3e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"映射 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"os.environ"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包含本章前面介绍的环境变量。例如，要访问环境变量 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"PYTHONPATH"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可使用表达式 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"os.environ['PYTHONPATH']"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6d